{
    "title": "BabyBus TV:Kids Videos & Games",
    "description": "Unlock a World of Educational Fun for Your Little Explorers with babypanda TV.\r\n\r\nCalling all parents and guardians of little explorers! babypanda TV is the perfect app to spark your child's imagination and inspire a lifelong love of learning.\r\n\r\nA world of fun and educational content\r\n\r\nImmerse your child in an enchanting world filled with their favorite characters, from baby pandas Kiki and Miumiu to dinosaurs and monster cars. With over 600 episodes of engaging children's songs, cartoons and interactive games, there's something for every curious mind.\r\n* Habits: Instilling good habits like brushing teeth and taking showers\r\n* Art: Unleashing creativity through drawing, doodling, and music\r\n* Safety: Teaching crucial safety knowledge for home, travel, and emergencies\r\n* Cognition: Expanding knowledge about dinosaurs, cars, food, numbers, and more\r\n* Emotions: Nurturing empathy and social skills\r\n* Knowledge: Math, English videos and games\r\n\r\nWe understand that parents want to provide the best experience for their children. That's why we've equipped babypanda TV with user-friendly features that give you peace of mind:\r\n\r\n* Screen Time Control: Set limits to ensure balanced screen time for your little one.\r\n* Free Downloads: Enjoy over 600 episodes of kids' songs and cartoons at no cost.\r\n* Offline Viewing: Download videos for convenient entertainment on the go.\r\n* Auto Save: Track your child's viewing history to monitor their progress.\r\n* Full Screen Play: Immerse your child in the captivating world of BabyBus TV.\r\n* Privacy Protection: We prioritize your child's safety and privacy with our stringent data protection measures.\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n* Our mission is to provide high-quality educational content that fosters creativity, imagination, and a lifelong love of learning.\r\n\r\nJoin the BabyBus adventure today and watch your child embark on an extraordinary journey of discovery!\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: babybustv01@gmail.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Unlock a World of Educational Fun for Your Little Explorers with babypanda TV.<br><br>Calling all parents and guardians of little explorers! babypanda TV is the perfect app to spark your child&#39;s imagination and inspire a lifelong love of learning.<br><br>A world of fun and educational content<br><br>Immerse your child in an enchanting world filled with their favorite characters, from baby pandas Kiki and Miumiu to dinosaurs and monster cars. With over 600 episodes of engaging children&#39;s songs, cartoons and interactive games, there&#39;s something for every curious mind.<br>* Habits: Instilling good habits like brushing teeth and taking showers<br>* Art: Unleashing creativity through drawing, doodling, and music<br>* Safety: Teaching crucial safety knowledge for home, travel, and emergencies<br>* Cognition: Expanding knowledge about dinosaurs, cars, food, numbers, and more<br>* Emotions: Nurturing empathy and social skills<br>* Knowledge: Math, English videos and games<br><br>We understand that parents want to provide the best experience for their children. That&#39;s why we&#39;ve equipped babypanda TV with user-friendly features that give you peace of mind:<br><br>* Screen Time Control: Set limits to ensure balanced screen time for your little one.<br>* Free Downloads: Enjoy over 600 episodes of kids&#39; songs and cartoons at no cost.<br>* Offline Viewing: Download videos for convenient entertainment on the go.<br>* Auto Save: Track your child&#39;s viewing history to monitor their progress.<br>* Full Screen Play: Immerse your child in the captivating world of BabyBus TV.<br>* Privacy Protection: We prioritize your child&#39;s safety and privacy with our stringent data protection measures.<br><br>About BabyBus<br>* Our mission is to provide high-quality educational content that fosters creativity, imagination, and a lifelong love of learning.<br><br>Join the BabyBus adventure today and watch your child embark on an extraordinary jou